{"name": "Sparkball", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sparkball is a 4v4 adrenaline-packed \u2018sports brawler\u2019 where players select from a cast of lovably unique heroes and carefully balance both ballin' and brawlin' to score in the enemy team's goal! <br/><br/>Affectionately described as League of Legends meets Rocket League, Sparkball grips you immediately with its dopamine-inducing take on combat sports and keeps you coming back for more as you strive to master its surprisingly complex strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/10d28ffbc0d9c2e1d9aec4805cd356de.avif?t=1761856063\" width=\"600\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master a roster of unique heroes, each with distinct abilities and playstyles.</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras_big/eb3b0dc974552805c1268c92c63c112c.avif?t=1761856063\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/eb3b0dc974552805c1268c92c63c112c.avif?t=1761856063\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/a06061f0b1f31db46a178ca44d775179.avif?t=1761856063\" width=\"600\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle your opponents with strategic precision\u2014or just pure chaos! Knock them off the ball, defend your goal, and dominate the field.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"288\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\